<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's CVRD H1 net jumps 127 pct vs yr ago.</title>
<headline>Brazil's CVRD H1 net jumps 127 pct vs yr ago.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian mining giant Cia Vale do Rio Doce, which was privatized in May, posted the following first half financial results.</p>
<p>		   Jan-June 1997		 Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>Net Profit	252.2 million		 111.1 million</p>
<p>Share	     0.65			    0.29</p>
<p>Net Revenues    1.53 billion		  1.29 billion</p>
<p>Note: All figures are in Brazilian reais and are not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>The company said its January through June net profit jumped 127 percent from the first half of 1996.</p>
<p>((Simona de Logu, Rio de Janeiro newsroom 5521 5074151))</p>
